+# BLUE CURRENT V51.20.0 — DATA INTEGRITY & RECOVERY
+
+V51.16–V51.20 adds the data-integrity and recovery certification layer required before restaurant pilot use.
+
+## Integrity scope
+
+Blue Current now evaluates the authoritative restaurant data model for:
+
+- reservations
+- guest profiles
+- floor tables
+- floor sections
+- staff
+- employees
+- kitchen stations
+
+Each collection is checked for:
+
+- duplicate entity IDs
+- malformed records missing identity/organization scope
+
+No duplicate or malformed record is converted into a pass.
+
+## Persistence / retry / reconciliation verification
+
+The verification workflow reuses existing Blue Current infrastructure:
+
+- DatabaseService durable temp-file persistence and replace/fallback behavior
+- database reload support
+- IdempotencyService
+- SyncReconciliationService
+
+A controlled verification checks:
+
+- entity integrity
+- duplicate prevention
+- idempotency reservation reuse
+- persistence across database reload
+- reconciliation state readability
+
+The verification record also captures the existing interrupted-write recovery model.
+
+## Human evidence and certification
+
+Verification requires human-recorded evidence.
+
+Final integrity/recovery certification requires:
+
+- a passing verification
+- admin permission
+- a human certification note
+
+Certified state:
+
+`DATA_INTEGRITY_RECOVERY_CERTIFIED`
+
+## Important separation
+
+The verification may create integrity-test metadata such as a temporary idempotency record in the isolated/target database, but it does not mutate restaurant reservation, floor, staff, guest, or kitchen operating state.
+
+It does not automatically repair data.
+
+It does not automatically reconcile divergent clients.
+
+## Current authenticated Chefs runtime
+
+Current untouched authoritative state:
+
+`data-integrity-ready-for-certification`
+
+All five in-scope restaurants currently pass the static integrity readiness model:
+
+- Marina Grille — 5/5
+- Harbor House — 5/5
+- River & Rail — 5/5
+- The Cabin — 5/5
+- Garden Social — 5/5
+
+Current duplicate/malformed identity findings:
+
+- 0 across all five locations
+
+This is readiness for controlled integrity verification, not final certification. Human verification/certification has not yet been recorded.
+
+## Safety policy
+
+- assessment read-only
+- duplicate prevention required
+- idempotency verification required
+- reconciliation verification required
+- restart persistence required
+- interrupted-write recovery required
+- human certification required
+- automatic repair false
+- automatic reconciliation false
+- autonomous production changes false
+
+## Validation
+
+- V51.20 focused integrity/recovery lifecycle PASS
+- duplicate detection PASS
+- idempotency verification PASS
+- reload persistence PASS
+- reconciliation readability PASS
+- interrupted-write recovery model PASS
+- human certification workflow PASS
+- V51.15 regression PASS
+- authenticated integrity GET PASS
+- admin certification boundary PASS
+- authoritative DB unchanged
+- undefined module exports: 0
+- duplicate HTML IDs: 0
+- npm run check PASS
+- 929 JavaScript files
+- 778 client scripts
+- 5,802 unique HTML IDs
+
+## Next
+
